# KiCad project placeholder

This directory will contain the KiCad project files for the ESP32-S3 Environment Station. Below are the planned filenames and a summary of contents so you can validate before I generate the final .sch/.kicad_pcb files:

Planned files:
- esp32-s3-env-station.kicad_pro
- schematic/esp32-s3-env-station.sch
- pcb/esp32-s3-env-station.kicad_pcb
- footprint_libs/ (custom footprints if needed)
- gerber/ (generated Gerber files)

PCB design notes (to be implemented in KiCad):
- Board size: 80 x 60 mm
- Module: ESP32-S3-WROOM castellated footprint, keepout for antenna (if using PCB antenna)
- Power: USB-C input, TVS, fuse, LDO (AP2112) for 3.3V
- I2C pull-ups (2.2k) with 0-ohm jumpers to disable
- UART level shifter for PMS7003
- ADC input filtering for soil sensor
- 2x relay driver transistors and flyback diodes
- Mounting holes: 4 x M3 at corners (5mm clearance from edges)

I'll generate the full KiCad schematic and PCB in the next commit; this placeholder explains the intended netlist and constraints.
